    {
      "source": "Portable <code>Model API</code> across AI providers for <code>Chat</code>, <code>Text to Image</code>, <code>Audio Transcription</code>, <code>Text to Speech</code>, and <code>Embedding</code> models.\nBoth <code>synchronous</code> and <code>stream</code> API options are supported.\nDropping down to access model specific features is also supported.",
      "translation": "跨 AI 提供商实现<code>Model API</code>的便携性，支持<code>Chat</code>、<code>Text to Image</code>、<code>Audio Transcription</code>、<code>Text to Speech</code>和<code>Embedding</code>模型。\n同时支持<code>synchronous</code>和<code>stream</code>两种 API 选项。\n也支持向下访问特定模型的专属功能。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"chatclient.html\">ChatClient API</a> offers a fluent API for communicating with an AI Model, idiomatic to Spring developers and similar to <code>WebClient</code> or <code>RestClient</code>.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"chatclient.html\">ChatClient API</a> 提供了一个流畅的 API，用于与 AI 模型通信，其风格符合 Spring 开发者的习惯，类似于 <code>WebClient</code> 或 <code>RestClient</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Portable <code>Vector Store API</code> across multiple providers, including a novel <code>SQL-like metadata filter API</code> that is also portable. Support for many vector databases is available.",
      "translation": "支持跨多个提供程序的可移植<code>向量存储 API</code>，包括同样可移植的<code>类 SQL 元数据过滤 API</code>。支持多种向量数据库。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring AI makes it easy to have the AI model invoke your services as <code>@Tool</code>-annotated methods or POJO <code>java.util.Function</code> objects.",
      "translation": "Spring AI 使得 AI 模型能够轻松调用您的服务，这些服务可以是带有 `<code>@Tool</code>` 注解的方法，也可以是 POJO `<code>java.util.Function</code>` 对象。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Check the Spring AI <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"tools.html\">Tool Calling</a> documentation.",
      "translation": "查看 Spring AI<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"tools.html\">工具调用</a>文档。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"advisors.html\">Advisors API</a> encapsulates recurring Generative AI patterns, transforms data sent to and from Language Models (LLMs), and provides portability across various models and use cases (e.g., memory, tool-calling, RAG).",
      "translation": "<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"advisors.html\">顾问 API</a>封装了生成式 AI 的重复模式，转换发送给语言模型（LLM）及从语言模型接收的数据，并提供跨各种模型和使用场景（例如记忆、工具调用、RAG）的可移植性。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"mcp/mcp-overview.html\">MCP (Model Context Protocol)</a> - Seamless integration for building AI applications that consume MCP servers or expose Spring-based services to the AI ecosystem.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"mcp/mcp-overview.html\">MCP（模型上下文协议）</a> - 为构建消费 MCP 服务器或将基于 Spring 的服务暴露给 AI 生态系统的 AI 应用程序提供无缝集成。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The project’s <a href=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-ai/discussions\">GitHub discussions</a> is a great place to send feedback.",
      "translation": "项目的<a href=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-ai/discussions\">GitHub 讨论区</a>是发送反馈的好地方。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The Spring AI API covers a wide range of functionalities.\nEach major feature is detailed in its own dedicated section.\nTo provide an overview, the following key functionalities are available:",
      "translation": "Spring AI API 涵盖广泛的功能。\n每个主要功能都在其专属部分中详细说明。\n为提供概览，以下关键功能可用：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "With support for AI Models from OpenAI, Microsoft, Amazon, Google, Amazon Bedrock and more.",
      "translation": "支持来自 OpenAI、Microsoft、Amazon、Google、Amazon Bedrock 等机构的 AI 模型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Boot Auto Configuration and Starters for AI Models and Vector Stores.",
      "translation": "Spring Boot 自动配置与 AI 模型及向量存储的启动器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "ETL framework for Data Engineering.  This provides the basis of loading data into a vector database, helping implement the Retrieval Augmented Generation pattern that enables you to bring your data to the AI model to incorporate into its response.",
      "translation": "面向数据工程的 ETL 框架。它为将数据加载到向量数据库提供了基础，有助于实现检索增强生成（RAG）模式，使您能够将数据引入 AI 模型并整合到其响应中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
